{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/extras/42bcb0c02bad5ee153140b6471ac36ad.avif?t=1773826323\" width=500 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ArvusForge is a 3D rogue-like action game centered around resource gathering and crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to collect materials, craft powerful weapons, and push forward through a branching node-based world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique blend of strategic progression and exhilarating combat in this node-driven crafting action adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------- Objective ----------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an &quot;Elementer&quot; capable of processing various elemental energies, you will journey across countless worlds in pursuit of creating the ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather elements by defeating enemies and shattering ore veins found within each realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the elements you\u2019ve collected to forge a one-of-a-kind weapon that is truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------- Action ----------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/extras/f2cf4cd43306c94ca832656e564b1f9a.poster.avif?t=1773826323\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/extras/f2cf4cd43306c94ca832656e564b1f9a.webm?t=1773826323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/extras/f2cf4cd43306c94ca832656e564b1f9a.mp4?t=1773826323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ArvusForge features top-down action that requires no camera management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls limited to &quot;Attack&quot; and &quot;Dodge,&quot; anyone can jump straight into the fray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attacks evolve through a three-stage combo system, changing dynamically as you strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a diverse array of enemies and attack patterns in combat that is simple to learn yet deep to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------- Crafting System ----------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/extras/892dcaca0ea3b46ef6002f13aab8ed36.poster.avif?t=1773826323\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/extras/892dcaca0ea3b46ef6002f13aab8ed36.webm?t=1773826323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/extras/892dcaca0ea3b46ef6002f13aab8ed36.mp4?t=1773826323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items are defined by three traits: &quot;Color,&quot; &quot;Skill,&quot; and a &quot;Grid (up to 9 slots).&quot; Arrange these within the central workspace to forge your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crafting grid is divided into three sections, each corresponding to an attack stage (First, Second, and Third).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different skills to birth a wide variety of weapons tailored to your specific playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base stats increase according to color points, and reaching specific thresholds grants powerful bonus points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With materials and skill combinations changing every run, you can challenge yourself to create new weapons time and time again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------- The Ultimate Challenge ----------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A formidable boss awaits at the deepest level. Overcome this final trial to complete your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------- Key Features ----------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Playtime: Approximately 15\u201330 minutes per run. Replay to perfect your weapon-crafting mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Rogue-like Elements: Materials and skills are randomized, ensuring a fresh configuration every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Genre: Crafting Action / Rogue-like / Progressive Action</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4098930?t=1773826323","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4098930?t=1773826323","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/ddb9dcec889750560cd6a18f48c2e8229aa6a9dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773826323","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/ddb9dcec889750560cd6a18f48c2e8229aa6a9dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773826323","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4371700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/extras/42bcb0c02bad5ee153140b6471ac36ad.avif?t=1773826323\" width=500 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ArvusForge is a 3D rogue-like action game centered around resource gathering and crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to collect materials, craft powerful weapons, and push forward through a branching node-based world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique blend of strategic progression and exhilarating combat in this node-driven crafting action adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------- Objective ----------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an &quot;Elementer&quot; capable of processing various elemental energies, you will journey across countless worlds in pursuit of creating the ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather elements by defeating enemies and shattering ore veins found within each realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the elements you\u2019ve collected to forge a one-of-a-kind weapon that is truly your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------- Action ----------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/extras/f2cf4cd43306c94ca832656e564b1f9a.poster.avif?t=1773826323\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/extras/f2cf4cd43306c94ca832656e564b1f9a.webm?t=1773826323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/extras/f2cf4cd43306c94ca832656e564b1f9a.mp4?t=1773826323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ArvusForge features top-down action that requires no camera management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls limited to &quot;Attack&quot; and &quot;Dodge,&quot; anyone can jump straight into the fray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attacks evolve through a three-stage combo system, changing dynamically as you strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a diverse array of enemies and attack patterns in combat that is simple to learn yet deep to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------- Crafting System ----------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/extras/892dcaca0ea3b46ef6002f13aab8ed36.poster.avif?t=1773826323\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/extras/892dcaca0ea3b46ef6002f13aab8ed36.webm?t=1773826323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/extras/892dcaca0ea3b46ef6002f13aab8ed36.mp4?t=1773826323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items are defined by three traits: &quot;Color,&quot; &quot;Skill,&quot; and a &quot;Grid (up to 9 slots).&quot; Arrange these within the central workspace to forge your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crafting grid is divided into three sections, each corresponding to an attack stage (First, Second, and Third).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine different skills to birth a wide variety of weapons tailored to your specific playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base stats increase according to color points, and reaching specific thresholds grants powerful bonus points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With materials and skill combinations changing every run, you can challenge yourself to create new weapons time and time again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------- The Ultimate Challenge ----------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A formidable boss awaits at the deepest level. Overcome this final trial to complete your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>---------------- Key Features ----------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Playtime: Approximately 15\u201330 minutes per run. Replay to perfect your weapon-crafting mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Rogue-like Elements: Materials and skills are randomized, ensuring a fresh configuration every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Genre: Crafting Action / Rogue-like / Progressive Action</p>","developers":["UniqX Lab"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098930/ee3a129c918ddf02d040622d3fd4928fc9de54c1/header.jpg?t=1773826323","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4098930/1171699859/3a6b86d00e3c70a1d92c60eaebfe674838d4fe29/1763100812/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763105176","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4098930/1171699859/3a6b86d00e3c70a1d92c60eaebfe674838d4fe29/1763100812/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763105176","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4098930/1171699859/3a6b86d00e3c70a1d92c60eaebfe674838d4fe29/1763100812/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763105176","id":257231380,"name"